{"id":"vod_hh_130059","vodId":"130059","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"大贤者利多尔的时间逆行","name_cn":"大贤者利多尔的时间逆行","date":"2026-01-01","year":"2026","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第12集完结","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/689158564d7cee2866f059401ceb79d2.jpg"},"summary":"《大贤者利德尔的时空逆转》是一部全彩漫画，目前已在各大数字平台上线。这是一部完整的奇幻剧，讲述了主人公利德尔穿越回一千年前，阻止神秘组织“恶意之盒”导致世界崩塌，并努力拯救世界的故事。本作采用的“轻动画®”制作技术，是由大日本印刷株式会社（DNP）开发的新型工作流程，与传统方法相比，能够显著降低动画制作的时间和成本，并于2022年8月面向企业用户推出。《大贤者利德尔的时空逆转》是DNP与小学馆联合制作的动画播出企划的首部作品。由于动画采用原作画风，因此能够充分展现原作精美的插画，相信能够满足原作粉丝的期待","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-07-05 12:00:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aM8QvEOe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/eZ6V2oge/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/bo2V25Ka/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/azpvqDZd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/e1wWDVGb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/epY8pqma/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/aADN4pBe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/e0RY4G5b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/bDkq13xa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/epYZXyra/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/e0R8yzXb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集完结","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dyPw4Bzb/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:58.455Z"}